pmc:GhayaTilasmKharabMadina a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:GhayatAlHakim ;
    rdfs:label "Ruining a city or a place, in the hour of Saturn"@en, "Eine Stadt oder einen Ort verderben, in der Stunde des Saturn"@de ;
    skos:definition "Made in the hour of Saturn when it is malefic, with the ascendant of the town and its lord afflicted, the benefics kept away from the ascendant and its lord and dropped from the triplicities of the ascendant and the angles; buried in the middle of the city."@en ;
    skos:note "The Latin chapter has no talisman under a heading for this purpose that could be matched to this one, and the node cites the Arabic and Atallah only."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:IslamicLetterMagic ;
    dcterms:source "Ghāyat al-Ḥakīm I.5, the talisman: ruining a city or a place, in the hour of Saturn, ed. H. Ritter (1933)" ;
